# benign-sum.layer-a
# Tenant submission: a BENIGN pure-computation task.
#
# Intent: an agent submitted a program that computes 40 + 2 and returns the
# result. It declares no effects, so its effect closure is empty: the host can
# read from the artifact that the maximum harm this program can cause is
# nothing -- no filesystem, no network, no credential access. It admits cleanly
# under any policy (even the empty grant set) and runs to a correct result.
#
# Used by S4 (run-by-hash): ingested into a PersistentStore (admit-and-verify-
# once), then re-run by root hash with no re-verification, producing 42.
@v=1 root=sum
a ILT 40
b ILT 2
sum APP add [a b]
